       and East European languages (Latin‐2) ISO/IEC 8859‐3 Southeast European
       and   miscellaneous   languages   (Latin‐3)   ISO/IEC  8859‐4 Scandina‐
       vian/Baltic   languages   (Latin‐4)    ISO/IEC    8859‐5 Latin/Cyrillic
       ISO/IEC       8859‐6 Latin/Arabic       ISO/IEC      8859‐7 Latin/Greek
       ISO/IEC 8859‐8 Latin/Hebrew  ISO/IEC  8859‐9 Latin‐1  modification  for
